---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CalEmbed from "../components/CalEmbed.tsx";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About REX Bunny Services | AI Search Optimization Agency"
  description="REX Bunny Services engineers your brand into AI search results. Founded to bridge the gap between traditional web development and the AI-powered search future."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "About", url: "/about" }
  ]}
>
  <section class="pt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-5xl">
        We Exist Because <span class="text-brand-400">Search Changed Forever</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-dark-300">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          In 2024, Google launched AI Overviews. OpenAI released GPT-4o with web browsing. Perplexity reached 10M monthly users.
          The way people find businesses fundamentally shifted — but most agencies kept building websites the same way.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          REX Bunny Services was founded to bridge that gap. We combine next-gen web performance engineering with
          deep expertise in how Large Language Models crawl, index, and cite sources. We don't just build fast websites —
          we build websites that AI search engines <strong class="text-white">trust</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          We are a small, focused team of web engineers and AI optimization specialists. Unlike large agencies that spread
          their attention across dozens of service lines, we专注 on three core disciplines: building high-performance websites,
          ranking them in traditional search, and engineering them to be cited in AI-generated answers. This narrow focus
          means every team member is an expert in their domain.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Why AI Search Changes Everything</h2>
        <p>
          Traditional SEO asks: "How do I rank on Google?" Generative Engine Optimization asks: "How do I get cited in ChatGPT?"
          The answer is fundamentally different. LLMs don't just look at backlinks and keywords — they evaluate entity clarity,
          structured data depth, content authority, and technical trustworthiness. A website that's invisible to AI crawlers
          (like GPTBot) is invisible to the AI-powered search experience that millions now use daily.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our GEO methodology addresses this directly: we optimize your entity signals, configure AI crawler access,
          implement comprehensive structured data, and engineer citation-worthy content that LLMs can confidently recommend.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          We don't believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. Every engagement starts with a thorough audit of your current
          web performance, SEO health, and AI visibility. From there, we build a tailored strategy that addresses your
          specific gaps — whether that's fixing Core Web Vitals, restructuring your data for machine readability, or
          creating content designed to be cited by AI systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every recommendation we make is backed by data. We track Lighthouse scores, AI citation frequency, search
          rankings, and conversion metrics to prove ROI — not just activity.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900 p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">Web Dev</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-dark-400">Lighthouse 98 avg</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900 p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">SEO</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-dark-400">Programmatic at scale</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-500/30 bg-dark-900 p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">GEO</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-dark-400">AI search specialists</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 text-center">
        <CalEmbed buttonText="Book a Strategy Call →" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
